'''Aerodactyl ex''' (Japanese: '''プテラex''' ''Ptera ex'') is a {{ct|Fighting}} Stage 1 {{TCGP|Pokémon ex}} card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Mythical Island}} expansion.

