==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's shiny super rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Aerodactyl}}.
*'''Land Crush''' is an attack that first appeared as '''Fissure''' on {{TCG ID|Gym Heroes|Brock's Golem|20}} from the {{TCG|Gym Heroes}} expansion.
*'''Primeval Law''' is an {{TCG|Ability}} close in both name and effect to '''Primal Law''', an Ability which first appeared on {{TCG ID|Darkness Ablaze|Dracovish|53}} from the {{TCG|Darkness Ablaze}} expansion.
**Its effect also resembles that of Prehistoric Power, the {{TCG|Pokémon Power}} of Aerodactyl's [[Aerodactyl (Fossil 1)|first TCG card]].

